# Repo-internal agent guidance, not documentation pages.
#
# Mintlify publishes every root-level markdown file it finds, whether or not
# docs.json references it. AGENTS.md is generated by
# .agents/global-rules/build_agents_md.py and opens with an HTML comment
# banner, which MDX cannot parse -- so any commit touching it failed the whole
# deployment and left the site on its previous build. The generator is shared
# by every repo, so the file cannot be made MDX-safe here; it is excluded
# instead.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
.agents/
